      "cookedHtml": "<h2><a name=\"p-17794177-h-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-17794177-h-1\" aria-label=\"标题链接\"></a>开篇</h2>\n<p>最近，有人私下联系我，主动提出收购用户对话数据，价格是 <strong>1M token 10 元</strong>。之前在抖音上总刷到这种，我以为是闹着玩的，结果来真的？我平台定价才1块5人民币每百万啊…<br>\n</p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/original/4X/0/9/4/094f709f4fbd0e84ca8ef8767e64a38ee835ff9f.png\" data-download-href=\"/uploads/short-url/1kmuMy6g8fb7rgMIpZ09tI1akq3.png?dl=1\" title=\"image\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"><img src=\"https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/0/9/4/094f709f4fbd0e84ca8ef8767e64a38ee835ff9f_2_684x500.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"1kmuMy6g8fb7rgMIpZ09tI1akq3\" width=\"684\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/0/9/4/094f709f4fbd0e84ca8ef8767e64a38ee835ff9f_2_684x500.png, https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/0/9/4/094f709f4fbd0e84ca8ef8767e64a38ee835ff9f_2_1026x750.png 1.5x, https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/0/9/4/094f709f4fbd0e84ca8ef8767e64a38ee835ff9f_2_1368x1000.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"EFF0F1\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1582×1156 90.2 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div><br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/original/4X/c/3/3/c33d1e0725b13c2c3a938fce93a285306ae42269.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"/uploads/short-url/rRa35YsWgEr4hmR805mDhZhNYEx.jpeg?dl=1\" title=\"image\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"><img src=\"https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/c/3/3/c33d1e0725b13c2c3a938fce93a285306ae42269_2_426x500.jpeg\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"rRa35YsWgEr4hmR805mDhZhNYEx\" width=\"426\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/c/3/3/c33d1e0725b13c2c3a938fce93a285306ae42269_2_426x500.jpeg, https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/c/3/3/c33d1e0725b13c2c3a938fce93a285306ae42269_2_639x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/c/3/3/c33d1e0725b13c2c3a938fce93a285306ae42269_2_852x1000.jpeg 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"6D7983\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1240×1452 146 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div><br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/original/4X/f/3/f/f3fbfdf101a40c1713f6b74026ec1dcedeb7e72d.png\" data-download-href=\"/uploads/short-url/yOnULzhU0nGhEaPuDkGdvTlz8D3.png?dl=1\" title=\"image\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"><img src=\"https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/f/3/f/f3fbfdf101a40c1713f6b74026ec1dcedeb7e72d_2_681x499.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"yOnULzhU0nGhEaPuDkGdvTlz8D3\" width=\"681\" height=\"499\" srcset=\"https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/f/3/f/f3fbfdf101a40c1713f6b74026ec1dcedeb7e72d_2_681x499.png, https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/f/3/f/f3fbfdf101a40c1713f6b74026ec1dcedeb7e72d_2_1021x748.png 1.5x, https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/f/3/f/f3fbfdf101a40c1713f6b74026ec1dcedeb7e72d_2_1362x998.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"EEEFF0\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1582×1160 102 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div><p></p>\n<h3><a name=\"p-17794177-h-5wok5-2\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-17794177-h-5wok5-2\" aria-label=\"标题链接\"></a>还有日赚5万的大佬，wok，光卖对话数据就能日赚5万，这一定是真大佬，但我想说一句：</h3>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>做人要有良心</strong></p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>震惊归震惊，但本站绝对不会干这种事。因为我自己是开发者，我太清楚隐私的重要性了。平时我懒的动脑的时候，甚至会把 <strong>服务器 IP、明文账户密码</strong> 丢给 AI，让它帮我搞环境、写配置、做运维……这些都是常有的事。</p>\n<p>比空口说白话更有说服力的是：<strong>我自己也在用自己的中转站。</strong></p>\n<p></p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/original/4X/8/3/1/83112a51c0eb38eae2b67ce0e2f61a593a1c77de.png\" data-download-href=\"/uploads/short-url/iHtk9OXUenEOI9rLUlJh5HB5fcO.png?dl=1\" title=\"image\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"><img src=\"https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/8/3/1/83112a51c0eb38eae2b67ce0e2f61a593a1c77de_2_690x428.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"iHtk9OXUenEOI9rLUlJh5HB5fcO\" width=\"690\" height=\"428\" srcset=\"https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/8/3/1/83112a51c0eb38eae2b67ce0e2f61a593a1c77de_2_690x428.png, https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/8/3/1/83112a51c0eb38eae2b67ce0e2f61a593a1c77de_2_1035x642.png 1.5x, https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/8/3/1/83112a51c0eb38eae2b67ce0e2f61a593a1c77de_2_1380x856.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F9FAFB\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">2560×1588 397 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div><p></p>\n<p>所以我可以<strong>负责任地</strong>说：<br>\n<strong>我的站使用的 API，用户数据绝不会被挪作他用。我只赚自己该赚的钱，不收集、保留用户数据。做人做事要讲良心，这是底线。</strong></p>\n<h1><a name=\"p-17794177-gpt-pro-20xonetokenshhttpsonetokensh-3\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-17794177-gpt-pro-20xonetokenshhttpsonetokensh-3\" aria-label=\"标题链接\"></a>另外给我自己打个广告，本站坚持只用正价GPT Pro 20X账号，尽可能保证用户体验，且绝不掺水、保留、出售用户对话数据，本站网址：<a href=\"https://onetoken.sh\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">OneToken.sh</a></h1>\n<p></p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/original/4X/a/7/a/a7ad31228cbc2dde2f117e3f0f4113ac0bd2614b.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"/uploads/short-url/nVkNzyaF49C6URPCkn7WIYVLcqT.jpeg?dl=1\" title=\"b51d21a47cc22986d09b3b188f03bb35\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"><img src=\"https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/a/7/a/a7ad31228cbc2dde2f117e3f0f4113ac0bd2614b_2_280x500.jpeg\" alt=\"b51d21a47cc22986d09b3b188f03bb35\" data-base62-sha1=\"nVkNzyaF49C6URPCkn7WIYVLcqT\" width=\"280\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/a/7/a/a7ad31228cbc2dde2f117e3f0f4113ac0bd2614b_2_280x500.jpeg, https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/a/7/a/a7ad31228cbc2dde2f117e3f0f4113ac0bd2614b_2_420x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/a/7/a/a7ad31228cbc2dde2f117e3f0f4113ac0bd2614b_2_560x1000.jpeg 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"EEF5FB\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">b51d21a47cc22986d09b3b188f03bb35</span><span class=\"informations\">1284×2289 260 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div><p></p>\n<h3><a name=\"p-17794177-h-1015gpt551000token-4\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-17794177-h-1015gpt551000token-4\" aria-label=\"标题链接\"></a>抽个奖，抽10个站内15积分对应GPT5.5额1000万Token</h3>\n<hr>\n<h3><a name=\"p-17794177-h-5\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-17794177-h-5\" aria-label=\"标题链接\"></a>补充：我很清楚，发这个帖子、爆这个雷，对我自己肯定也有影响。虽然我嘴上说会遵守承诺，但有些朋友还是不会完全放心，这很正常。我也早就知道会有这种反应，但为了让同行和老友看到真实情况，一起警惕、共同反对这种行为，我还是决定发出来，帖子不会删。</h3>",
      "normalizedText": "开篇 最近，有人私下联系我，主动提出收购用户对话数据，价格是 1M token 10 元。之前在抖音上总刷到这种，我以为是闹着玩的，结果来真的？我平台定价才1块5人民币每百万啊… image1582×1156 90.2 KB image1240×1452 146 KB image1582×1160 102 KB 还有日赚5万的大佬，wok，光卖对话数据就能日赚5万，这一定是真大佬，但我想说一句： 做人要有良心 震惊归震惊，但本站绝对不会干这种事。因为我自己是开发者，我太清楚隐私的重要性了。平时我懒的动脑的时候，甚至会把 服务器 IP、明文账户密码 丢给 AI，让它帮我搞环境、写配置、做运维……这些都是常有的事。 比空口说白话更有说服力的是：我自己也在用自己的中转站。 image2560×1588 397 KB 所以我可以负责任地说： 我的站使用的 API，用户数据绝不会被挪作他用。我只赚自己该赚的钱，不收集、保留用户数据。做人做事要讲良心，这是底线。 另外给我自己打个广告，本站坚持只用正价GPT Pro 20X账号，尽可能保证用户体验，且绝不掺水、保留、出售用户对话数据，本站网址：OneToken.sh b51d21a47cc22986d09b3b188f03bb351284×2289 260 KB 抽个奖，抽10个站内15积分对应GPT5.5额1000万Token 补充：我很清楚，发这个帖子、爆这个雷，对我自己肯定也有影响。虽然我嘴上说会遵守承诺，但有些朋友还是不会完全放心，这很正常。我也早就知道会有这种反应，但为了让同行和老友看到真实情况，一起警惕、共同反对这种行为，我还是决定发出来，帖子不会删。",
      "contentHash": "9cd31af951103ba6bd73d0d643d507867c9532024fa1595a00893120701cc8d1"
